@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Sequence 9 of 9: a crashing page is contained by the error boundary (FR-APP-05)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
actor "athlete : Athlete" as A
participant "nav : Layout" as N
participant "guard : ErrorBoundary" as EB
participant "page : PlanPage" as PG
participant "err : PageError" as PE
participant "router : Router" as R

A -> N : tap "Plan"
N -> R : navigate("/schedule")
R --> EB : render with resetKey = "/schedule"
EB -> PG : render children
activate PG
PG -> PG : render throws (for example bad data)
PG --> EB : error
deactivate PG
EB -> EB : getDerivedStateFromError(error)
EB -> EB : componentDidCatch(error, info) : console.error, onError
EB -> PE : fallback(error, reset)
PE --> A : "This page ran into a problem" with Try again and Go to Home
note over N : The navigation outside the boundary keeps working.
alt athlete taps "Try again"
  A -> PE : Try again
  PE -> EB : reset()
  EB -> PG : render children again
  alt data is still bad
    PG --> EB : error
    EB --> A : message stays on screen
  else data is fixed
    PG --> A : the page renders normally
  end
else athlete opens another page
  A -> N : tap "Body"
  N -> R : navigate("/body")
  R --> EB : resetKey changed
  EB -> EB : componentDidUpdate : error cleared
  EB -> PG : render the Body page
  PG --> A : Body page works
end
note over EB
  A second ErrorBoundary around the whole app
  (data store, profile, shell) shows a Reload screen
  if something outside the pages fails.
end note
@enduml
